          "author": "Yoto",
          "description": "Nellie, Buzz and Gibbs are learning all about flight! They’ll explore everything from the roots of air travel from Greek mythology, to Leonardo da Vinci’s first studies of flight. They’ll head back in time to jump on the first hot air balloon ride, before Nellie joins Amelia Earhart on her mission to become the first woman to fly solo across the Atlantic Ocean. \n\nBonus Chapter - Make a paper airplane with Nellie! \n",
